{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）早上7時57分，大圍積福街一小學內發現，一名男子被發現昏迷倒地，懷疑從高處墮下。救援人員接報趕抵，證實該名男子當場死亡。</p><p>據知，死者年約30多歲，並非學校教職員。警方正調查事主尋短原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方向學校職員了解。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149647551012802560036984.jpeg/2RLGDPl8L54UuNn11q2AKG5fav195S9LVCG2TH4htkw\"/><figcaption>警方向學校職員了解。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男子昏迷倒地，懷疑從高處墮下，當場不治。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149647548244430848670598.jpeg/EvMXh16Ew8MsgyztUUN5Tj0KSO92RMzrtKiMuJ6ojLg\"/><figcaption>一名男子昏迷倒地，懷疑從高處墮下，當場不治。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149647545236983808902467.jpeg/OvEmiePFEFmbwKRMpl0CGHLEggmlAiONGEZYsjJGWLI\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子尋短原因仍待調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260703/1149652805363961856160579.jpeg/qjsZnWf95kw8X-85aelPz4tebZ4mBBovk8tpi7nLaYs\"/><figcaption>男子尋短原因仍待調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T01:58:15.590017+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}